{"id":"4c3fe677631170c2","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure.md","title":"Real Algebraic Roots over the D.c.e. Field","display":"thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure — Real Algebraic Roots over the D.c.e. Field","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure","aliases":["43-thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure"],"display":"thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure — Real Algebraic Roots over the D.c.e. Field","depends_on":["[[43-df-dce-real]]","[[43-thm-dce-field]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 8.5.8; conclusion following Lemma 8.5.19","source_printed_pages":"154–159","source_pdf_pages":"174–179","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure — Real Algebraic Roots over the D.c.e. Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"192242ff132fc1ff\" href=\"?note=192242ff132fc1ff\" title=\"43-thm-dce-field\">43-thm-dce-field</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 8.5.8; conclusion following Lemma 8.5.19"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"154–159"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"174–179"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(n)\\ne0\">\\(a(n)\\ne0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{DCEReal}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\mathrm{DCEReal}(a(i))\\right)\\land\\sum_{i=0}^{n}a(i)r^i=0\\implies\\mathrm{DCEReal}(r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\mathrm{DCEReal}(a(i))\\right)\\land\\sum_{i=0}^{n}a(i)r^i=0\\implies\\mathrm{DCEReal}(r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 8.5.8 的“实闭”在嵌入实数域的情形可表为对全部实代数根封闭；与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"192242ff132fc1ff\" href=\"?note=192242ff132fc1ff\" title=\"43-thm-dce-field\">43-thm-dce-field</a> 合起来给出实闭子域性质。零次非零多项式没有根，故边界情形不制造见证。该节证明使用分析函数的根与有界变差近似；此处核对最终陈述及多项式应用段，没有逐行核验所有 Newton 迭代引理。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 8.5.8; conclusion following Lemma 8.5.19；印刷页 154–159，PDF 页 174–179。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dce-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-dce-field","status":"resolved","id":"192242ff132fc1ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-dce-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb R$，$a(n)\\ne0$，$r\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-dce-field","status":"resolved","id":"192242ff132fc1ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Theorem 8.5.8 的“实闭”在嵌入实数域的情形可表为对全部实代数根封闭；与 [[43-thm-dce-field]] 合起来给出实闭子域性质。零次非零多项式没有根，故边界情形不制造见证。该节证明使用分析函数的根与有界变差近似；此处核对最终陈述及多项式应用段，没有逐行核验所有 Newton 迭代引理。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"a(n)\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\mathrm{DCEReal}(a(i))\\right)\\land\\sum_{i=0}^{n}a(i)r^i=0\\implies\\mathrm{DCEReal}(r).","display":true}],"bytes":1674,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dce-real-algebraic-closure]] — Real Algebraic Roots over the D.c.e. Field"}],"outgoing":["2485b90ec527f97e","192242ff132fc1ff"]}